OL,3,GNEWSABaby burnt and screamed in agony
OL,4,Aafter hot gravy spill in pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum whose daughter suffered burns
OL,7,Fafter spilling piping hot gravy on
OL,8,Fherself in a pub has warned others not
OL,9,Fto place hot liquids in front of babies
OL,10,Fand small children.
OL,12,FCatrin Griffiths, 29, from Bangor,
OL,13,FGwynedd, fears eight-month-old Neli
OL,14,Fwill be scarred for life on her hand
OL,15,Fand leg.
OL,17,FShe said a pub waitress "accidentally"
OL,18,Fplaced a gravy boat by her daughter
OL,19,Fwhen they went out for a roast dinner.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
