OL,3,GNEWSABaby burnt and screamed in agony
OL,4,Aafter hot gravy spill in pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FGriffiths said it took Neli a split
OL,7,Fsecond to dunk her left hand into the
OL,8,Fjug. She then "yelped", pulled out her
OL,9,Fhand and spilt the gravy on her left
OL,10,Fleg.
